    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "If we assume The global budget for this project is 3 million euros and our target gross margin is 28%, then the projected revenue would be 3 million euros and the projected cost would be approximately 2.16 million euros (3 million * (1 - 0.28))." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for cost-optimization strategies, according to the cost sensitivity information, our could consider absorbing costs via rate renegotiation with subcontractors in case of a 10% budget reduction." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For larger budget reductions, scope reduction or removal of optional modules might be necessary." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without more specific details about this project and this project associated costs, it is difficult to provide tailored advice on cost optimization." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must provide intelligent assistance (req:req14), accompany administrative activities (req:req15), search for information in internal procedures and applicable regulation (req:req16), draft letters or answers to users (req:req17), instruct files (req:req18), suggest actions or steps (req:req19), and integrate with existing systems while ensuring explainability of recommendations or proposals issued by The solution (req:req40)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's LLM stack, RAG capabilities, fine-tuning methods, explainability tools, performance benchmarks, past AI use cases, and known trade-offs as of 2024, how do our company's design an innovative AI component that meets these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To design an innovative AI component meeting these requirements, our company's can leverage our company's LLM stack, particularly our company's preferred sovereign model Mistral 7B Instruct, and RAG capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, for intelligent assistance and accompaniment of administrative activities, our company's can fine-tune our preferred sovereign model Mistral 7B Instruct on a corpus of internal procedures, applicable regulations, and administrative documents using methods like LoRA or QLoRA to achieve the desired tone and format adaptation without significant performance degradation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To enable search for information in internal procedures and applicable regulation, our company's RAG capabilities can be utilized with retrieval strategies such as Dense vector (semantic) or Hybrid (RRF fusion), integrating with vector stores like Qdrant or Weaviate." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This will facilitate efficient and accurate information retrieval to support drafting letters, answering user queries, instructing files, and suggesting actions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For drafting letters or answers to users and instructing files, our preferred sovereign model Mistral 7B Instruct can generate high-quality content based on the input prompts and context provided by the RAG system." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The average accuracy gain from fine-tuning of around 12% is expected to significantly improve our preferred sovereign model Mistral 7B Instruct performance in these tasks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To suggest actions or steps and ensure integration with existing systems, our company's can develop an API-based interface for our preferred sovereign model Mistral 7B Instruct that allows seamless interaction with other applications within the organization. an API-based interface for our AI component that allows seamless interaction with other applications within the organization will enable our preferred sovereign model Mistral 7B Instruct to receive input from various sources, process input, and provide recommendations or proposals back to the users or systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the emphasis on explainability (req:req40), our company's will implement XAI methods such as source citation through RAG grounding, chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, or LIME." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "XAI methods such as source citation through RAG grounding, chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, or LIME will provide insights into how our preferred sovereign model Mistral 7B Instruct arrives at our preferred sovereign model Mistral 7B Instruct recommendations or proposals, enhancing trust and compliance with regulatory requirements like the EU AI Act. our company's past experience in delivering AI solutions for public administration, legal sector, healthcare, and smart city domains can serve as valuable references to ensure the new solution meets specific domain needs while adhering to known trade-offs such as explicability vs. performance, online learning vs. GDPR, model size vs. energy consumption, and the choice between RAG and fine-tuning based on the application scenario." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By carefully balancing these factors and leveraging our company's existing capabilities in LLMs, RAG, fine-tuning, and explainability, our company's can design an innovative AI component that not only meets but exceeds the specified requirements, offering a robust, compliant, and user-centric solution for administrative assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The city of Belval aims to limit the environmental footprint of The city of Belval systems of information (con:con38), contribute to the reduction of energetic consumption (con:con39), and rely on infrastructures with low carbon impact (con:con40)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's EcoVadis rating, carbon footprint, green hosting partners, digital sobriety practices, social commitments, AI ethics principles, and known sustainability trade-offs as of 2024, how do our company's propose to support these environmental objectives through our company's solution? our company's can support these environmental objectives by leveraging our company's EcoVadis Silver rating and expertise in sustainability. our company's green hosting partners, OVHcloud and Scaleway, both use 100% renewable energy and have ISO14001 certification, which aligns with con:con40. our company's can host The city of Belval systems on these infrastructures to reduce the city's systems carbon footprint. our company's digital sobriety practices, such as INT8/INT4 model quantisation, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and green IT hardware procurement policy, can help reduce energy consumption (con:con39) by an estimated 35% compared to our company's baseline." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "These practices also contribute to con:con38 by minimizing the environmental footprint of the city's systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "While The city of Belval current carbon footprint is 148 tons of CO2 equivalent, our company's are committed to reducing our current carbon footprint and have set a net-zero target for 2040. our company's can provide The city of Belval with regular carbon reporting based on GRI Standards (partial) to ensure transparency and track progress." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's known sustainability trade-offs, such as balancing high availability with energy consumption and model size with performance, demonstrate our company's ability to navigate complex environmental challenges. our company's can work with The city of Belval to find similar balances that meet The city of Belval specific needs while minimizing environmental impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By partnering with our company's, The city of Belval can benefit from our company's expertise in sustainable IT practices, green hosting, and digital sobriety, ultimately supporting The city of Belval objectives to reduce energetic consumption and rely on low-carbon infrastructures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "There are no agents' answers provided." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

