        ex:hasText "Environmental constraints In the framework of City of Belval policy of sustainable development, City of Belval wishes to limit the environmental footprint of City of Belval systems of information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk55> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The holder will have to propose a solution contributing to the reduction of the energetic consumption and relying, as much as possible, on infrastructures with low carbon impact. 9." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk56> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Modalities of deployment the project will have to be conducted in a progressive manner, with: a pilot phase on a limited scope, a progressive generalization to the entirety of the services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk57> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An accompaniment to the change and actions of training of the agents will be expected. 10." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk58> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Criteria of evaluation of the offers the offers will be evaluated with regard to the following criteria: quality and relevance of the proposed solution, compliance to the regulatory requirements, level of security, global cost of the proposed solution, taking into account of the environmental issues, capacity of innovation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk59> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the requirements for the city of Belval to implement an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents (req:req1), improve efficiency of administrative services (req:req2), and improve quality of service rendered to users (req:req3), as well as the constraints related to accessibility, accompaniment, search for information, drafting of letters or answers, instruction of files, suggestion of actions or steps, integration into existing practices, and continuity of file processing (con:con1 to con:con15), what is our company's approach to managing these requirements and ensuring a successful project outcome? our company's would manage these requirements by first applying our company's project management capabilities, which include methodologies such as PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFe." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk6> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution into the existing practices of the agents and not constitute a rupture in the agents modes of work. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk60> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the complexity of the requirements and constraints, our company's would likely adopt a structured approach like PRINCE2 to ensure all aspects are properly addressed. our company's would start with the inception and design phase, where our company's work closely with the city of Belval stakeholders to understand the city's stakeholders needs and define the project scope, goals, and deliverables." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk61> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This includes addressing each of the requirements (req1, req2, req3) and constraints (con1 to con15) to ensure that our company's solution meets all the specified needs. our company's experience in managing public sector projects, with 23 completed projects as of the reference year 2024, would be invaluable in navigating the administrative and technical challenges associated with implementing an artificial intelligence solution within a government entity. our company's would leverage our company's certifications, including PMP and PRINCE2 Practitioner, to ensure that the project is managed according to industry best practices." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk62> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the specific requirements for improving efficiency of administrative services and quality of service rendered to users through AI assistance, our company's would draw on our company's expertise in digital transformation and AI solutions. draw might involve integrating our solution with existing systems to enhance accessibility, accompaniment, search for information, and other specified functionalities. our company's approach to change management would be crucial in ensuring user adoption and minimizing disruption to existing practices. our company's have a dedicated change manager and offer various training delivery methods, including in-person workshops and e-learning, tailored to the needs of the city of Belval agents and users." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk63> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Risk management is another critical aspect of our company's project management capabilities. our company's maintain a risk register and review risks bi-weekly, categorizing risks into technical, financial, regulatory, operational, and reputational risks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk64> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's low-to-medium risk appetite, our company's would work closely with the city of Belval to identify, assess, and mitigate any risks associated with the project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk65> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Finally, our company's experience in leading consortia, having led 8 consortia with up to 5 partners, could be beneficial if the project requires collaboration with other specialized companies, such as our company's known partners EuroCloud Solutions S.A., LexIA GmbH, or GreenCompute S.r.l., depending on the specific needs of the AI solution and the AI solution integration with existing systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk66> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging our company's project management capabilities, sector expertise, and experience in public sector projects, our company's believe our company's can deliver a successful outcome for the project, meeting all specified requirements and constraints while ensuring a smooth transition and long-term benefits for both the administrative services and the users the administrative services serve." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk67> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must integrate with existing systems of information (con:con27), business softwares (con:con28), electronic management of documents (con:con29), and user directories (con:con30), and provide APIs (con:con31)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk68> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, the hosting infrastructure should be of SecNumCloud type or equivalent (con:con33) with attention to dependence on non-European suppliers (con:con34)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk69> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our current technology stack and performance benchmarks, how do our propose to design and implement integrate while meeting the technical constraints?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk7> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Functional scope The expected solution will have to cover the following functionalities: 3.1 Assistance with the consultation of information The expected solution will have to allow the agents to access quickly to reliable and up-to-date information coming from: the internal procedures, the applicable regulatory texts, the internal documents (guides, notes, repositories)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk70> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To integrate with existing systems of information, business software, electronic document management, and user directories, our can utilize our experience in API standards such as REST, GraphQL, SOAP, and CMIS. our will also leverage our expertise in API gateways like Kong, Apigee, and AWS API Gateway to provide secure and managed APIs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk71> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For integrating with existing systems, our have experience with message brokers like Apache Kafka and RabbitMQ, which can facilitate communication between different systems. our knowledge of GED systems such as Alfresco, Maarch Courrier, and OpenKM will be useful for electronic document management integration." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk72> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our familiarity with identity providers like Active Directory/LDAP, Keycloak, and FranceConnect will help in integrating user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk73> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding hosting infrastructure, our have experience with SecNumCloud deployments, having done three such deployments in the past. our can design the infrastructure to meet the equivalent security standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk74> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To minimize dependence on non-European suppliers, our can utilize our partnerships with green hosting partners like OVHcloud and Scaleway, which are based in Europe and offer 100% renewable energy-powered services. our technical expertise in cloud architecture, cybersecurity, and data engineering will ensure that integrate is secure, scalable, and performant. our will also ensure that the solution meets the required performance benchmarks, including a p95 response time of 1800 ms and availability of 99.92%.  our can use our IaC tools like Terraform and Ansible to automate the infrastructure deployment and management, ensuring consistency and reducing the risk of human error. our monitoring tools like Prometheus, Grafana, and ELK stack will help in keeping track of the system's performance and security." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk75> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, with our technical expertise and experience in integration, cloud architecture, cybersecurity, and data engineering, our are well-equipped to design and implement integrate while meeting the specified technical constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk76> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The proposed solution must comply with regulatory requirements (con:con44), ensure sovereignty of data (con:con16 and con:con32), host data exclusively within the European Union (con:con17), protect data using encryption and anonymization if necessary (con:con19), and guarantee a high level of security (con:con46)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk77> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering our company's current certifications, GDPR instruments, AI security controls, audit capabilities, and experience with the European Union regulatory frameworks as of 2024, how do our company's ensure compliance with these constraints? our company's can ensure compliance with The proposed solution by leveraging our company's existing certifications, such as ISO 27001, which covers the design, development, and operation of AI-powered information systems, and is valid until 2026. our company's experience with GDPR instruments, including the appointment of a Data Protection Officer and the implementation of data subject rights, also supports compliance with data sovereignty and protection requirements. our company's standard data residency policy ensures that data is hosted exclusively within the European Union, meeting the constraint con:con17. our company's also have anonymisation tools, such as Microsoft Presidio and custom NER models, to protect data if necessary, aligning with con:con19." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk78> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of security, our company's access control standards, including multi-factor authentication and role-based access control design experience, contribute to a high level of security, addressing con:con46. our company's network security architecture patterns, such as Zero-trust and micro-segmentation, also support contribute." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk79> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's AI security controls, including prompt injection protection, output PII redaction, and adversarial input detection, further ensure the security of AI-powered components. our company's audit and logging capabilities, with all queries logged and log immutability ensured through SHA-256 hash chaining, provide a reliable means of monitoring and investigating security incidents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk8> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to be in measure to contextualize the answers in function of the demand of the agent. 3.2 Assistance with the drafting The expected solution will have to propose a help with the drafting of administrative contents, notably: answers to the users, administrative letters, syntheses of files." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk80> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, our company's current certifications, GDPR instruments, AI security controls, audit capabilities, and experience with the European Union regulatory frameworks provide a solid foundation for ensuring compliance with the proposed constraints as of 2024." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk81> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance, explainability and auditable outputs from AI systems (req:req40, req:req41), and adherence to sector-specific regulatory obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk82> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's legal standing, procurement experience across EU jurisdictions, IP model, insurance, standard contractual clauses, and AI regulatory posture as of 2024, what are the key legal risks our company's should flag, and how do our company's demonstrate compliance?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's context, the key legal risks to flag in relation to the tender requirements are primarily centered around GDPR compliance, explainability and audibility of AI systems, and adherence to sector-specific regulatory obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, regarding GDPR compliance, since our company's operations are intra-EU and our company's utilize the standard legal basis of Article 6(1)(e) for data processing, our company's should ensure that our company's Data Processing Agreement (DPA) template version is up-to-date and compliant with the latest GDPR requirements. our company's also need to confirm that our company's DPIA support is readily available in case any data protection impact assessments are required during the project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Secondly, concerning explainability and auditable outputs from AI systems, our company's must demonstrate our company's capability to provide transparent AI practices, adhering to the EU AI Act's requirements for limited-risk AI applications. demonstrate includes ensuring human oversight and validation of automated decisions, which aligns with our company's no-automated-decision-without-human-validation policy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, regarding sector-specific regulatory obligations, while our company's experience in public procurement across various EU jurisdictions is extensive, including familiarity with specific regulations like the French Code Commande Publique, our company's need to carefully review The tender sector-specific requirements. review involves ensuring compliance with any unique regulatory standards applicable to the project, leveraging our company's knowledge of AI regulatory evolution and our company's awareness of prohibited AI practices." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To demonstrate compliance, our company's should prepare detailed documentation showcasing our company's GDPR compliance measures, including our company's DPA template and DPIA support capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For AI explainability and audibility, our company's need to provide evidence of our company's transparent AI development processes, human oversight mechanisms, and adherence to the EU AI Act's transparency obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, a thorough review of sector-specific regulations relevant to The tender should be conducted, and our company's compliance strategies for sector-specific regulations relevant to the tender should be clearly outlined in our company's proposal." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The generated contents will have to be adapted to the administrative context and compliant with the requirements of quality expected. 3.3 Assistance with the instruction of files The expected solution will have to be in measure to assist the agents in the analysis and the processing of files, by: proposing relevant information, recalling the applicable rules, suggesting actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of insurance and liability, our company's have professional indemnity, cyber liability, and performance bond capacity that can mitigate risks associated with non-compliance or contractual breaches. our company's standard contractual clauses also include mechanisms for termination, data return, and destruction, which are crucial for maintaining GDPR compliance throughout the contract duration." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, by carefully addressing these legal risk areas and demonstrating our company's proactive approach to compliance through detailed documentation and adherence to regulatory standards, our company's can effectively mitigate risks and present a strong proposal that meets The tender stringent requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

